<import src="../../components/states.wxml"/><view class="page"><template is="feedback" data="{{loading,error}}"/><view class="heading">我的体重核验</view><block wx:if="{{!loading && !error}}"><view class="card"><view class="title">{{dashboard.month}} 月度体重</view><view>基准 {{dashboard.baseline.kg || '待核验'}} kg · 当前 {{dashboard.current.kg || '待核验'}} kg</view><view class="notice mt">原始体重与材料仅本人及核验人员可见。减重榜仅使用通过核验的记录。</view><form bindsubmit="submit"><view class="field">记录来源<radio-group name="source"><label><radio value="manual" checked/>手工</label><label><radio value="photo"/>拍照证据</label><label><radio value="scale"/>绑定秤（模拟）</label></radio-group></view><view class="field"><view>体重 25–300kg</view><input name="kg" type="digit" value="{{form.kg}}"/></view><button class="btn soft small" bindtap="photo">选择核验照片</button><view class="field"><textarea name="evidence" value="{{evidence}}" placeholder="核验说明 / 照片路径"/></view><button class="btn primary" form-type="submit">提交核验</button></form></view><view class="card mt"><view class="title"><image class="section-symbol" src="/images/ui/edit.svg"/>记录</view><view class="item" wx:for="{{dashboard.rows}}" wx:key="id">{{item.date}} · {{item.kg}}kg · {{statusLabels[item.status] || item.status || '已记录'}}</view></view><view class="card mt" wx:for="{{dashboard.reviews}}" wx:key="id"><view>{{item.date}} · {{item.kg}}kg · {{statusLabels[item.status] || item.status}}</view><view>{{item.note}}</view><form wx:if="{{item.status === 'rejected'}}" bindsubmit="appeal" data-id="{{item.id}}"><view class="field"><input name="note" placeholder="申诉说明"/></view><button class="btn soft" form-type="submit">提交申诉</button></form></view><button class="btn soft small" data-url="/pages/weight-review/index" bindtap="go"><image class="feature-entry-icon" src="/images/ui/sun.svg" mode="aspectFit"/><text>运营核验入口</text></button></block></view>